reserve the same DescriptionId\n\nPARENT RELATIONSHIPS\n- Attach parent\n- Prevent circular relationships\n- Detach parent\n\nSUB-NODE INTERACTION\n- Select requested sub-node type\n- Add sub-node\n- Continue into the separate Node Creation workflow\n\n\nPersisted Node\n      ↓\nReconstituted\n      ↓\nActive ←→ Archived\n      ↓\nModified while retaining NodeId\n\n\nLoad and reconstitute\nRename\nChange type\nChange requested sub-node types\nEdit description\nAttach parent\nDetach parent\nArchive\nRestore\nAdd sub-node entry point\n\n\nThe description-editing section would clearly show that Content owns the actual update:\nNode supplies its existing DescriptionId\n→ Content loads the Document\n→ Content changes the text\n→ Content saves the same DocumentId\n→ Graph Node remains unchanged","autoResize":true,"lineHeight":1.25}],"appState":{"currentItemStrokeColor":"#1e1e1e","currentItemBackgroundColor":"transparent","currentItemFillStyle":"solid","currentItemStrokeWidth":2,"currentItemStrokeStyle":"solid","currentItemRoughness":1,"currentItemOpacity":100,"currentItemFontFamily":5,"currentItemFontSize":20,"currentItemTextAlign":"left","currentItemStartArrowhead":null,"currentItemEndArrowhead":"arrow","scrollX":-394.1282087732371,"scrollY":-394.5034721140972,"zoom":{"value":0.513808},"currentItemRoundness":"round","gridSize":20,"frameRendering":{"enabled":true,"clip":true,"name":true,"outline":true},"objectsSnapModeEnabled":false},"files":{}}